<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 266.00).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-1/4 (FIM 266.00).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $0-1/4 at $57-1/4 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 266.00 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 3.90 markka at 265.90.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at $34-3/4 on Wall Street on Friday. The price equals about 80.70 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet rose 0.60 markka to close at 80.90 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-1/8 at $20-3/4 in New York on Friday. The price corresponds to about 96.40 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma added 1.50 to end at 98.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
